      "answer": "Risk monitoring involves tracking identified risks, monitoring residual risks, identifying new risks, and evaluating the effectiveness of the risk process throughout the project. This process is part of the Monitoring & Controlling process group and occurs in parallel with the Executing process group. It's a continuous activity that helps ensure identified risks are actually addressed, not just documented, and that new risks are identified and managed as they arise.",
